[
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-1",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族の中で、朝いちばんに話したくなる話題は？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-2",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族と過ごす時、落ち着く場所や時間はある？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-family-fit-001",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族との食事で、落ち着いて話せるのはどんな雰囲気？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-4",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族の口ぐせで思い浮かぶものは？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-5",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族と過ごすなら、外出と家で過ごすのどちらが好き？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-family-fit-002",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族と作品を見るなら、感想はいつ話し合いたい？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-family-fit-003",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族と生活の時間帯が違う時、どんな気づかいがあるとうれしい？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-8",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族からもらって嬉しかったものは？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-family-fit-004",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族と過ごす場所で、居心地のよさにつながるものは何？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-family-fit-005",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族と旅行するなら、どんな時間を一緒に楽しみたい？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-11",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "最近、家族にありがとうと思ったことは？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-12",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族の中で、自分と性格が似ている人はいる？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-13",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族と一緒に挑戦してみたいことは？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-14",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族の写真を撮るなら、どんな瞬間を残したい？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-15",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族の話で、つい笑ってしまう思い出は？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-16",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族の間で続いている小さな習慣はある？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-17",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族におすすめしたい本や作品は？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-18",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族と季節を感じるのは、どんな時？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-19",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族と静かに過ごす時間は好き？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-20",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族から言われると嬉しい言葉は？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-21",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族との食事で、よく思い出す料理はある？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-family-fit-006",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族の得意なことで、教わってみたいことはある？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-25",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "今度の休日、家族と何をして過ごしたい？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-family-fit-007",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族とお茶をするなら、どんな話をしてみたい？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-27",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族と散歩するなら、どこまで歩きたい？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-28",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族の意外な一面を見たことはある？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-family-fit-008",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族で出かける行き先は、どんな決め方だと楽しみになる？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-1-35",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族が知らない自分の小さな特技はある？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-1-36",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族との思い出の場所で、もう一度行きたいところはある？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-1-37",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族の昔の写真で、印象に残っているものは？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-1-38",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族と過ごしたお祝いの中で、印象に残っているものはある？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-1-39",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "小さい頃に家族から言われて、今も覚えている言葉は？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-1-42",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族とよく見ていたテレビ番組はあった？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-1-44",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族と過ごした夏の思い出はある？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-1-45",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族が集まる時によく出てくる、昔の話はある？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-1-46",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族と一緒につくった工作や作品を覚えている？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-1-48",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族と過ごした休日や記念日で、印象に残っていることはある？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-1-50",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "家族と撮った写真の中で、また見返したくなる一枚はある？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-2-1",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族とは毎日連絡を取りたい？必要な時だけでいい？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-2-2",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族と意見が違った時、すぐ話し合いたい？少し時間を置きたい？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-2-3",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族に謝るのは得意？苦手？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-2-4",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "困った時、家族に相談する方？一人で考える方？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-2-5",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族で決めることと、自分で決めたいことの違いは？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-care-2-6",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族に助けてほしい時、どんな頼み方なら言いやすい？",
    "category": "familyCare",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-2-7",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族のいいところを一つ挙げるなら？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-2-8",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族に直してほしいと思うことはある？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-boundaries-2-9",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族にも知られたくないことはある？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-care-2-10",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族に応援してほしいことはある？",
    "category": "familyCare",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-boundaries-2-11",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族との距離が近すぎると感じる時はある？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-2-12",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "失敗したことを家族に話せる？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-2-13",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族の中で考え方が一番違うと感じることは？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-2-14",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族とお金の話をする時、どんなことに気をつけたい？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-2-15",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族と過ごす時間は、長さと密度のどちらが大事？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-2-16",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族に期待しすぎているかもしれないと思うことは？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-family-fit-010",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族の中で自分が担いがちな役割を、どう感じている？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-care-2-18",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族が元気がない時、そっとしておく？声をかける？",
    "category": "familyCare",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-2-19",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族に言いにくいけれど、伝えた方がいいと思うことはある？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-2-20",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族について、自分が思い込んでいたことはある？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-2-21",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族と連絡を取るなら、電話とメッセージどっちが多い？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-2-22",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族との会話で、聞き役に回ることが多い？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-2-23",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族に自分の予定を、どこまで共有している？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-2-25",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族に感謝を伝える機会は、足りていると思う？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-2-26",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族との言い合いの後、後悔することはある？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-2-27",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族から学んだことで、自分も大事にしていることは？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-2-28",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族の真似してみたい習慣はある？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-2-29",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族の中で、自分だけは譲れない価値観はある？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-2-30",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族の考え方で、自分には合わないと感じるところはある？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-2-31",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族にとっての豊かさとは、何だと思う？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-2-32",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族のルールの中で、意味が分かりにくいものはある？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-care-2-33",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族の疲れが顔に出ていると感じた時、何て声をかける？",
    "category": "familyCare",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-care-2-34",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "最近、家族にしてあげたいことはある？",
    "category": "familyCare",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-care-2-35",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "自分が元気がない時、家族にはどう接してほしい？",
    "category": "familyCare",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-care-2-36",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族の健康について、気にかけていることはある？",
    "category": "familyCare",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-family-fit-011",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族からの感謝は、どんな言葉だと心に残る？",
    "category": "familyCare",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-boundaries-2-41",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族からのアドバイスが、受け取りにくいと感じる時はある？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-boundaries-2-42",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族に干渉されたくないと感じる場面は、どんな時？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-boundaries-2-43",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族との約束ごとで、自分から守りたいものはある？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-boundaries-2-44",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族に割り込まれたくない、自分だけの時間はある？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-2-45",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族と過ごす時間があるとしたら、どんな過ごし方が理想？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-2-46",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族と分け合って食べたい料理はある？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-2-47",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "今度の家族との予定で、楽しみにしていることはある？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-2-48",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族と買ってよかったものはある？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-daily-2-50",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "家族との時間の中で、小さくても幸せを感じる瞬間はある？",
    "category": "familyDaily",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-3-1",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族に自分の考えを分かってもらえない時、どうしたい？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-3-2",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族だからこそ分かってほしいと思うことは？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-3-3",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族と価値観が違っても、一緒にいられると思う？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-care-3-4",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族のために我慢していることはある？",
    "category": "familyCare",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-family-fit-012",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族の期待と自分の希望が違う時、どんなふうに話したい？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-3-6",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族に本音を話すために必要なことは何だと思う？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-3-7",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族の関係をよくしているものは何だと思う？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-future-3-8",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族と違う道を選ぶことに不安はある？",
    "category": "familyFuture",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-3-9",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族にとっての幸せは、自分にとっての幸せと同じだと思う？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-3-10",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族に変わってほしいと思うことを、伝えるべきだと思う？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-care-3-11",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族を支える時、どんな距離感が自分にとって無理のない形だと思う？",
    "category": "familyCare",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-3-12",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族の過去について、もっと知りたいことはある？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-3-13",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族に伝えられていない謝りたいことはある？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-care-3-14",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族が困っていたら、自分の予定をどこまで変えられる？",
    "category": "familyCare",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-care-3-15",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族にとっての安心感は、言葉と行動のどちらで生まれると思う？",
    "category": "familyCare",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-3-16",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族と意見が合わない時、理解することと納得することは別だと思う？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-3-17",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族から受け継いだと思うものはある？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-boundaries-3-18",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族との距離を自分で決めたいと思う時はある？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-3-19",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族に弱さを見せることは、頼ることだと思う？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-future-3-20",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "これから家族とどんな時間を増やしたい？",
    "category": "familyFuture",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-3-21",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族の生き方で、自分が影響を受けたと思う部分はある？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-3-22",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族と同じ選択をしなかった経験はある？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-3-23",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族同士を比べられた経験は、自分にどう残っている？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-3-24",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族の幸せと自分の幸せが違う方向だったら、どう考えたい？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-3-25",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "「うちの家らしい」と感じる瞬間は、どんな時？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-3-26",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族と深い話をするきっかけは、自然に生まれる方がいい？決めてつくる方がいい？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-3-27",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族との間に沈黙が続いた時、何を感じる？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-3-28",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族の本音を、知りたくないと感じたことはある？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-family-fit-013",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族との言い合いで、言い方を変えてみたい場面はある？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-3-30",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族との会話で、一番避けている話題はある？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-care-3-31",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族を支えることと、自分を支えることは両立できていると思う？",
    "category": "familyCare",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-care-3-32",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族のために手放しかけたものはある？",
    "category": "familyCare",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-family-fit-014",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族が弱音を話さない時、どんな関わり方をしたい？",
    "category": "familyCare",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-care-3-35",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族への思いやりが、義務のように感じられる時はある？",
    "category": "familyCare",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-future-3-36",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "数年後、家族との関係は今より近くなっていると思う？遠くなっていると思う？",
    "category": "familyFuture",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-future-3-37",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族と住む場所が離れることを、どう感じる？",
    "category": "familyFuture",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-future-3-38",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族のこれからの計画について、自分の意見を言える？",
    "category": "familyFuture",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-future-3-39",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "自分の将来の選択が家族に与える影響を、考えたことはある？",
    "category": "familyFuture",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-future-3-40",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族と一緒に始めたい新しい習慣はある？",
    "category": "familyFuture",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-3-41",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族の過去の選択について、聞いてみたいことはある？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-3-42",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "自分がまだ知らない家族の過去について、知りたいことはある？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-3-43",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族との思い出について、今なら正直な気持ちを言える？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-3-44",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族の古い写真を見直すと、当時の空気が伝わってくることはある？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-3-45",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族から聞いた話で、自分の生き方の参考になっているものはある？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-boundaries-3-46",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族との境界線を引いた時、罪悪感を覚える？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-boundaries-3-47",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族の決まりに従う時、その理由を自分でも説明できる？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-boundaries-3-48",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族に自分の時間や空間を尊重してほしいと、はっきり伝えたことはある？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-boundaries-3-49",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "自分にとって心地よい家族との距離感は、どのくらい？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-boundaries-3-50",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "家族だからこそ越えてはいけない一線はあると思う？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-boundaries-4-1",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族との関わりで苦しくなった時、自分を守るためにできることは？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-boundaries-4-2",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族だから許さなければいけない、と思うことはある？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-4-4",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族の期待を背負うことに疲れた時、誰に相談したい？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-boundaries-4-5",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族と距離を置くことは、関係を大切にする方法にもなり得る？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-future-4-6",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族が自分の選択を認めてくれなかったら、どうする？",
    "category": "familyFuture",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-4-7",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族に謝ってほしいことがあるなら、伝える？待つ？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-4-8",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族に謝りたいことがある時、伝える前に考えたいことは？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-family-fit-015",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族に伝えにくいことを相談するなら、どんな場が必要？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-future-4-10",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族の事情と自分の人生がぶつかったら、どこで線を引きたい？",
    "category": "familyFuture",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-4-11",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族の中で決められた役割から離れたいと思ったことはある？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-4-12",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族に理解されないままでも、自分の選択を進められる？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-care-4-13",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族に助けを求めることをためらうのは、なぜだと思う？",
    "category": "familyCare",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-4-14",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族に本当は分かってほしいことを、一つだけ伝えるなら何？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-future-4-15",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族との関係を変えるために、自分からできることはある？",
    "category": "familyFuture",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-4-17",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族の過去を知ることで、今の関係の見え方が変わると思う？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-boundaries-4-18",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族にも越えてほしくない境界線はある？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-4-19",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族に言葉で伝えられていない感謝はある？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-future-4-20",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "これから家族とどんな関係をつくっていきたい？",
    "category": "familyFuture",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-4-22",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族に本音を見せにくい時、どんなことが影響していると思う？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-communication-4-23",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族との関係にわだかまりがあると、それを認めるのは怖い？",
    "category": "familyCommunication",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-boundaries-4-26",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族からの期待が重すぎると感じたら、関係を保ちながら距離を変えられる？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-boundaries-4-27",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族の希望と自分の希望が違う時、どう折り合いをつけたい？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-family-fit-016",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族との関わりを減らすなら、残しておきたいつながりはある？",
    "category": "familyBoundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-4-31",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族が信じていることを、内心で疑ったまま過ごしたことはある？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-4-32",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族の価値観とぶつかった時、自分を曲げるべきだと思う瞬間はある？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-family-fit-009",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族への配慮で自分の目標を変える前に、話し合いたいことは？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-4-34",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族の中で自分だけ置き去りにされたと感じたことはある？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-values-4-35",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族の在り方を否定された時、自分自身を否定されたように感じる？",
    "category": "familyValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-family-fit-017",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族との関わり方を変えるなら、どんなペースで進めたい？",
    "category": "familyFuture",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-future-4-40",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族に、今伝えておきたいことはある？",
    "category": "familyFuture",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-family-fit-018",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族が困っている時、自分にできる範囲をどう伝えたい？",
    "category": "familyCare",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-family-fit-019",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族との思い出から、これからの関わりに生かしたいことはある？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-4-48",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族に話しにくいことがあると感じた時、どう向き合いたい？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "family-memories-4-50",
    "audience": "family",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "家族との記憶の中で、まだ整理できていない感情はある？",
    "category": "familyMemories",
    "source": "editorial"
  }
]
